    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": "notebook-growth-chapter",
        "title": "从问题到理解",
        "pages": [
          {
            "id": "growth-1",
            "title": "复利的逐期累积",
            "subtitle": "从逐期计算推导通式。",
            "layout": "grid",
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "growth-intro",
                "type": "prose",
                "text": "一个假想账户初始有 100 元，每期增长 10%，不取出利息。第一期后是 110 元，第二期增长的基础变成了 110 元，因此增加 11 元。这里的 10% 只是教学假设，不代表实际收益。",
                "study": {
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "text": "增长的基础",
                      "kind": "circle"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "增长的基础",
                      "kind": "bold"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "增长的基础",
                      "kind": "red",
                      "color": "#285f9e"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-eq",
                "type": "formula",
                "latex": "P_{n+1}=P_n(1+r), \\qquad P_n=P_0(1+r)^n",
                "text": "P₀ 是初始值，r 是每期增长率，n 是期数。每一期的增长率相同，但增加的绝对数值不同。",
                "study": {
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "text": "每一期的增长率相同",
                      "kind": "dots"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-table",
                "type": "comparison",
                "columns": [
                  "期数 n",
                  "期初数值",
                  "期末数值"
                ],
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "1",
                    "100",
                    "110"
                  ],
                  [
                    "2",
                    "110",
                    "121"
                  ],
                  [
                    "3",
                    "121",
                    "133.1"
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-steps",
                "type": "example",
                "prompt": "第三期末有多少？",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "id": "growth-s1",
                    "text": "第二期末：100 × 1.1² = 121。"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "growth-s2",
                    "text": "第三期末：121 × 1.1 = 133.1。"
                  }
                ],
                "result": "三期一共增加 33.1，而每期固定加 10 只会增加 30。",
                "study": {
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "text": "三期一共增加 33.1",
                      "kind": "check"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "growth-2",
            "title": "通式的适用条件",
            "subtitle": "增长率、存取与期数都属于模型条件。",
            "layout": "reading",
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "growth-bound",
                "type": "callout",
                "text": "这个公式假设每期增长率恒定，增长继续计入本金，期间没有额外存入或取出。条件改变时，需要重新建立模型。",
                "study": {
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "text": "期间没有额外存入或取出",
                      "kind": "underline"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-path",
                "type": "diagram",
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "id": "g0",
                    "label": "100"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "g1",
                    "label": "110"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "g2",
                    "label": "121"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "g3",
                    "label": "133.1"
                  }
                ],
                "edges": [
                  {
                    "from": "g0",
                    "to": "g1",
                    "label": "× 1.1"
                  },
                  {
                    "from": "g1",
                    "to": "g2",
                    "label": "× 1.1"
                  },
                  {
                    "from": "g2",
                    "to": "g3",
                    "label": "× 1.1"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-quiz",
                "type": "exercise",
                "questionType": "single",
                "question": "初始值 200，每期增长 5%，两期后是多少？",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "id": "growth-a",
                    "text": "210"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "growth-b",
                    "text": "220"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "growth-c",
                    "text": "220.5"
                  }
                ],
                "solution": [
                  "growth-c"
                ],
                "explanation": "200 × 1.05² = 220.5。",
                "points": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
